<title>SPAIN: Spain's Bankinter -5-mth profit up six pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Bankinter -5-mth profit up six pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankinter Chairman Jaime Botin said on Thursday that profit for the first five months of the year rose 6.4 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;In 1997...client funds that we managed grew 4.7 percent, investment 5.9 percent and profits grew 6.4 percent despite contributing amply to reserves,&quot; Botin said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
